    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <i>very</i> early prototype of Climbing Chaos: Much Earlier Access, where sharks with arms and legs defy physics (and basic motor skills) in a hilarious, experimental party game about climbing and exploring solo or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/27397fa3b5ff05198422c597d3a8b9e6.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/27397fa3b5ff05198422c597d3a8b9e6.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/27397fa3b5ff05198422c597d3a8b9e6.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/e7b66c9cccb8794324183aa84a4f0680.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your body and each arm independently to grab, climb, and explore a world designed for ragdoll physics moments, leaps of faith, teamwork, and hilarity. What should be as easy as reaching out and grabbing something is\u2026well, much harder than it looks. You'll laugh, you'll scream, and you'll probably fall a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/7b6b247d30b3ff79b127132183c3f845.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/7b6b247d30b3ff79b127132183c3f845.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/7b6b247d30b3ff79b127132183c3f845.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/92853a96afaee6619b9be6c658a53555.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players can scramble together in local multiplayer with co-op and versus modes of play. You can play remotely with Steam Remote Play Together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/d8c4062b2bddc34371ecd8e01b97f6f6.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/d8c4062b2bddc34371ecd8e01b97f6f6.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/d8c4062b2bddc34371ecd8e01b97f6f6.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/ea8139ddef8cc7d90a512db7f2bdd8bb.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't have friends to play with? A solo player can control multiple sharks and still enjoy the multiplayer experience by themselves. Spawn your squad of sharks and form chainlinks to swing and reach  high places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/3385f90a583db8cb4f4cee096b9f8edc.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/3385f90a583db8cb4f4cee096b9f8edc.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/3385f90a583db8cb4f4cee096b9f8edc.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/a4847e882e4d1d75de392d45460959c3.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of game modes and a playground full of toys to test out your acrobatic moves. Can you find and climb the giant shark statue? Or practice shark darts on the dart board? There\u2019s even a gladiator arena, where you can fight to be the last shark standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/31bd4609e6d25e0b7096830f56bb745f.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/31bd4609e6d25e0b7096830f56bb745f.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/31bd4609e6d25e0b7096830f56bb745f.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/2966c9b3f073ed19039f5fd260c1b17e.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still incredibly early (and it took some convincing of the studio heads to let us start talking about it already). The graphics are placeholder, but we think we\u2019re onto something with the gameplay. There are still tons of bugs, but it\u2019s already fun, so why not share the madness?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/180c566c5242afe457831433e50de95e.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/180c566c5242afe457831433e50de95e.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/180c566c5242afe457831433e50de95e.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s ridiculous and charmingly janky, but it's somehow still a blast. We'd love to hear what you think. If you're having a good time, follow us on Steam or join our Discord to get the latest updates and join us on this chaotic journey!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <i>very</i> early prototype of Climbing Chaos: Much Earlier Access, where sharks with arms and legs defy physics (and basic motor skills) in a hilarious, experimental party game about climbing and exploring solo or with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/27397fa3b5ff05198422c597d3a8b9e6.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/27397fa3b5ff05198422c597d3a8b9e6.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/27397fa3b5ff05198422c597d3a8b9e6.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/e7b66c9cccb8794324183aa84a4f0680.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your body and each arm independently to grab, climb, and explore a world designed for ragdoll physics moments, leaps of faith, teamwork, and hilarity. What should be as easy as reaching out and grabbing something is\u2026well, much harder than it looks. You'll laugh, you'll scream, and you'll probably fall a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/7b6b247d30b3ff79b127132183c3f845.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/7b6b247d30b3ff79b127132183c3f845.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/7b6b247d30b3ff79b127132183c3f845.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/92853a96afaee6619b9be6c658a53555.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players can scramble together in local multiplayer with co-op and versus modes of play. You can play remotely with Steam Remote Play Together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/d8c4062b2bddc34371ecd8e01b97f6f6.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/d8c4062b2bddc34371ecd8e01b97f6f6.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/d8c4062b2bddc34371ecd8e01b97f6f6.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/ea8139ddef8cc7d90a512db7f2bdd8bb.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't have friends to play with? A solo player can control multiple sharks and still enjoy the multiplayer experience by themselves. Spawn your squad of sharks and form chainlinks to swing and reach  high places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/3385f90a583db8cb4f4cee096b9f8edc.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/3385f90a583db8cb4f4cee096b9f8edc.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/3385f90a583db8cb4f4cee096b9f8edc.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/a4847e882e4d1d75de392d45460959c3.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a variety of game modes and a playground full of toys to test out your acrobatic moves. Can you find and climb the giant shark statue? Or practice shark darts on the dart board? There\u2019s even a gladiator arena, where you can fight to be the last shark standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/31bd4609e6d25e0b7096830f56bb745f.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/31bd4609e6d25e0b7096830f56bb745f.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/31bd4609e6d25e0b7096830f56bb745f.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/2966c9b3f073ed19039f5fd260c1b17e.webp?t=1746470145\" width=640 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still incredibly early (and it took some convincing of the studio heads to let us start talking about it already). The graphics are placeholder, but we think we\u2019re onto something with the gameplay. There are still tons of bugs, but it\u2019s already fun, so why not share the madness?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/180c566c5242afe457831433e50de95e.poster.avif?t=1746470145\" width=620 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/180c566c5242afe457831433e50de95e.webm?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541430/extras/180c566c5242afe457831433e50de95e.mp4?t=1746470145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s ridiculous and charmingly janky, but it's somehow still a blast. We'd love to hear what you think. If you're having a good time, follow us on Steam or join our Discord to get the latest updates and join us on this chaotic journey!</p>",
    "short_description": "Grab, climb, and tumble through this early prototype of a ridiculous physics-based party game! Move your body and each arm independently, climb anything you can grab, and embrace the chaos with up to four players. Is it too early to show this? Absolutely, but what's the worst that could happen?",
